  "prefLabel": "Ncr 212.02 Standard and Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 212.02 Standard and Burden of Proof. In all hearings governed by this chapter, the party asserting the affirmative of a proposition shall bear the burden of proving the truth of that proposition by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. #14254, INTERIM, eff 5-23-25; ss by #14447, eff 12-4-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr200.html"
